message: >-
  If this repository materially informs scholarly work, please cite the
  repository and the associated research paper when a stable citable
  publication is available.
title: Reality Bias Benchmark
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zheng
    given-names: Yeyu
repository-code: https://github.com/yu5-520/reality-bias-benchmark
url: https://github.com/yu5-520/reality-bias-benchmark
abstract: >-
  Open research repository for the Reality Bias programme and the Process
  Reality mechanism study in multi-agent AI systems. The repository contains
  reproducibility code, machine-readable research contracts, frozen evidence,
  semantic-lineage analysis, Process Reality / Dynamic CPR materials, and
  lineage-addressed repair interfaces.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - process reality
  - semantic lineage
  - process integrity
  - AI reliability
